ernment and king that seemingly  couldn't get the job done  the people were more like religious  zealots who carried out terrorist  attacks designed to further destabilize  the wakandan government  meanwhile the black panther fought to  ensure the survival of the legacy of his  ancestors  and keep his subjects safe at any cost  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite comic heroes are coming  soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

